  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/09/IMG-20140920-WA0017.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px\" /></p>\n<p>La Colla Gegantera Sant Roc de Onda ha participado este fin de semana en sendos desfiles en Benic&agrave;ssim y en Abar&aacute;n (Murcia). Adem&aacute;s, este viernes, a las 19.30 horas,&nbsp;estar&aacute; en la inauguraci&oacute;n de la Fira de Sant Miquel ondense.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/collagentaterabenicassimabaranmurcia/img-20140920-wa0009.jpg\" alt=\"img-20140920-wa0009\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/collagentaterabenicassimabaranmurcia/img-20140920-wa0017.jpg\" alt=\"img-20140920-wa0017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/collagentaterabenicassimabaranmurcia/img_20140920_193239.jpg\" alt=\"img_20140920_193239\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/collagentaterabenicassimabaranmurcia/img_20140920_193253.jpg\" alt=\"img_20140920_193253\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/collagentaterabenicassimabaranmurcia/img_20140920_193330.jpg\" alt=\"img_20140920_193330\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/collagentaterabenicassimabaranmurcia/img_20140920_193333.jpg\" alt=\"img_20140920_193333\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/collagentaterabenicassimabaranmurcia/img_20140920_193402.jpg\" alt=\"img_20140920_193402\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/collagentaterabenicassimabaranmurcia/img_201409